[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative\nterminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752916\">5050B34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753356\">7210E22</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Windscreen wiper motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N15</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the retaining bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the windscreen wiper assembly (3a), releasing the pin\n(3b) from the seating (3c) on the bodyshell.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046914.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the windscreen wiper assembly\nin its seating, fitting the pin in its seating on the body shell.</p><p>Tighten the bolts to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>WINDSCREEN WIPER ASSEMBLY</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Windscreen wiper motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N15</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2753356\">7210E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752916\">5050B34</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]